## 2. Common headers

For every `POST`, `PUT`, `PATCH` request:

`Accept: application/json`

`Content-Type: application/json`

For protected routes:

`Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}`

or:

`Authorization: Bearer {{artisan_token}}`<br>
`Authorization: Bearer {{company_token}}`<br>
`Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}`<br>

For idempotent POST routes, also send:

`X-Idempotency-Key: any-unique-value`


Use a different value each time, like:
* booking-001
* kyc-001
* withdraw-001
* apply-001

