### 4.2 Register

POST

`{{base_url}}/auth/register`

`{
  "email": "newclient1@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "account_type": "client",
  "country_id": 1,
  "timezone_name": "Africa/Lagos",
  "first_name": "John",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "phone_number": "+2348000000099"
}`

For company account:

`{
  "email": "newcompany1@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "account_type": "company",
  "country_id": 1,
  "timezone_name": "Africa/Lagos",
  "company_name": "Bright Services Ltd",
  "overview": "On-demand service company"
}`

