- client
- artisan
- company

### 4.3 Verify email

POST

`{{base_url}}/auth/verify-email`

Body:

`{
  "email": "newclient1@example.com",
  "token": "paste_verification_token_here"
}`

Note: in production mode, the token may not be returned in the register response.

