### 4.5 Login

Do this four times and save each token.

#### Client login

**POST**

`{{base_url}}/auth/login`

Body:

{
  "email": "{{client_email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

Copy data.access_token into client_token.

Artisan login

`{
  "email": "{{artisan_email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}`

Save as `artisan_token`.

Company login

`{
  "email": "{{company_email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}`

Save as `company_token`.

Admin login

`{
  "email": "{{admin_email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}`


